plex, Five Dates and Maid of Sker.","detailedDescription":"Tricked into reading an ancient book, Loralyn summons a demon into her home. Night Book is an interactive occult thriller movie, created in lockdown, from the publishers of The Complex, Five Dates and Maid of Sker.\n\r\n\n\r\nLoralyn works the night shift remotely from her home, live interpreting video calls from English to French and back again. Currently pregnant, with a husband working far away and caring for her mentally ill father, she is desperately trying to keep her family together and safe – but who is she prepared to sacrifice to survive? The fiancé, the baby, her father or herself?\n\r\n\n\r\nNight Book is a linear interactive movie with branching narratives and multiple endings.\n\r\n\n\r\n•\tOne story, several different paths and endings.\n\r\n•\tUnlock a Skip Scene function for multiple playthroughs.\n\r\n•\t15 ending variations and 220 scenes\n\r\n•\tProduced entirely remotely during the pandemic lockdown.\n\r\n•\tStarring Julie Dray (Cyberpunk 2077) and Colin Salmon (Resident Evil, Mortal Engines).","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477920/header.jpg?t=1780398416"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477920/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780398416"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477920/ss_3bf60d7d7e083b13e02ec1074be881f00bff628b.600x338.jpg?t=1780398416","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477920/ss_3bf60d7d7e083b13e02ec1074be881f00bff628b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780398416"},{"id":1,"thumbnailUrl":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477920/ss_ccfa78f1b9ec735373a1882adbd9b378a2100c1e.600x338.